how can you expect the command:

 geom_line(aes(x, y, group=label), data=dd, color='red', alpha = .1)

would color the lines?

You just set them all to red.

If you really follow examples on https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter2.html#ggtree-fortify, you should know how to do it by providing a variable (host in your case) in the dd and mapping color by aes to the variable.

